            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "阿三",
            "text": "我想想…不。得再往上加点，否则我不干。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101381",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10138101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10138101": {
            "id": "10138101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "阿三",
            "text": "客官，不行啊，太少，太少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101383",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10138301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10138301": {
            "id": "10138301",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "阿三",
            "text": "5只岩晶蝶…行吧，差不多就值这个价。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101385",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10138501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10138501": {
            "id": "10138501",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "阿三",
            "text": "嗯，交易愉快。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101387",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10138701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10138701": {
            "id": "10138701",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "阿二",
            "text": "这…不太行。多少再加点，我还能考虑考虑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101388",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10138801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10138801": {
            "id": "10138801",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "阿二",
            "text": "太少了，这价可不公道。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101390",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10139001"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10139001": {
            "id": "10139001",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "阿二",
            "text": "这价钱…行吧行吧，雇我一天，我也不亏了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101392",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10139201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10139201": {
            "id": "10139201",
            "speakerId": 1004,
            "speakerName": "阿二",
            "text": "嘿，有这么些摩拉，也算是好价吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101394",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10139401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10139401": {
            "id": "10139401",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "阿大",
            "text": "嗯？不不…再加点儿吧，这价钱真是，不值得专门跑一趟吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101395",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10139501"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10139501": {
            "id": "10139501",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "阿大",
            "text": "别啊，这也太少了吧。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101397",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "10139701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "10139701": {
            "id": "10139701",
            "speakerId": 1003,
            "speakerName": "阿大",
            "text": "我想想…成，这价也算公道，我就为你走一遭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "101399",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
